{"sha": "a04dede1ccc7069812caf2d33547d4d0fae019784af9c45e6532e50dfc29bc45", "body": ["\\chapter{Solving Problems}\\label{ch:g2:problems}", "", "数字故事里藏着一个问题：是加？是减？还是乘？", "本章介绍一种判断方法，用简单的条形图", "\\emph{看清}运算，并从表格和", "象形图中读取信息。", "", "\\section{选择运算}", "", "\\begin{method}[选择哪种运算？]\\label{met:g2:problems:choose}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item \\emph{合在一起，共有多少}：用加法（$+$）；", "  \\item \\emph{拿走一些，问还剩多少或相差多少}：用减", "        法（$-$）；", "  \\item \\emph{若干个相同的组}：用乘法（$\\times$）；", "  \\item 不确定时，画一个简单的图，并且", "        总用一句话作答。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.6]", "  % put together", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!20] (0,0) rectangle (3,0.8);", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omThm!20] (3,0) rectangle (4.6,0.8);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (1.5,0.4) {$24$};", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (3.8,0.4) {$15$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth] (0,-0.4) -- (4.6,-0.4);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2.3,-0.5) {共有多少：$24 + 15$};", "  % compare", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8cm]", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!20] (0,0.9) rectangle (4.6,1.7);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (2.3,1.3) {$40$};", "  \\draw[thick, fill=omThm!20] (0,0) rectangle (2.8,0.8);", "  \\node[font=\\small] at (1.4,0.4) {$28$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth] (2.8,0.4) -- (4.6,0.4);", "  \\node[below, font=\\small] at (2.3,-0.2) {相差多少：$40 - 28$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 条形图：两个条形相连表示加法，两个", "条形相比较表示减法。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[两步问题]\\label{ex:g2:problems:twostep}", "“萨姆买了 $3$ 包贴纸，每包 $6$ 张，然后送出 $5$ 张。", "他还剩多少张？”", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 先算总数：$3 \\times 6 = 18$ 张；", "  \\item 送出去：$18 - 5 = 13$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "萨姆还剩 $13$ 张贴纸。再读一遍题目，故事", "真的结束了吗？本题答案是肯定的。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[隐藏的多余数字]\\label{ex:g2:problems:extra}", "“一本 $210$ 页的书\\,\\dots” --- 注意，并非", "故事里的每个数字都有用。“本恩有 $8$ 个红弹珠和 $6$ 个蓝弹珠，", "他 $7$ 岁。一共有多少个弹珠？”年龄是个干扰项：", "$8 + 6 = 14$ 个弹珠。先筛选数字，再计算。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{表格与象形图}", "", "\\begin{example}[表格]\\label{ex:g2:problems:table}", "小摊卖出的糕点：", "\\begin{center}", "\\renewcommand{\\arraystretch}{1.3}", "\\begin{tabular}{l|ccc}", " & 星期六 & 星期日 & 总数 \\\\", "\\hline", "松饼 & $12$ & $9$ & $21$ \\\\", "挞 & $7$ & $10$ & $17$ \\\\", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "读表：星期日的挞有 $10$ 个。计算：两天", "的松饼共 $12 + 9 = 21$ 个；星期日的挞比星期六多 $10 - 7 = 3$ 个。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[象形图]\\label{ex:g2:problems:pictogram}", "先看图例：这里一个苹果代表 $2$ 个水果。", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.62]", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,2) {红色};", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,1,2,3} \\fill[omThm] (0.5+\\i*0.75,2) circle (0.24);", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,1) {绿色};", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,1} \\fill[omMeth] (0.5+\\i*0.75,1) circle (0.24);", "  \\node[left, font=\\small] at (0,0) {黄色};", "  \\foreach \\i in {0,1,2} \\fill[omProp] (0.5+\\i*0.75,0) circle (0.24);", "  \\node[right, font=\\small] at (4.0,1) {图例：一个圆点 $= 2$ 个水果};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 象形图：红色有 $4$ 个圆点，所以红色", "水果有 $4 \\times 2 = 8$ 个；绿色 $2$ 个圆点，$4$ 个水果；黄色 $3$ 个圆点，$6$ 个水果。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g2:problems:1}", "说出运算（不要计算）：“$34$ 和 $28$ 个弹珠", "合在一起”；“$50$ 块糖果，吃掉 $12$ 块”；“$4$ 盒苹果，", "每盒 $5$ 个”；“安娜有 $30$ 个，利奥有 $18$ 个：安娜比利奥多多少个？”。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g2:problems:2}", "求解：“停车场有 $156$ 辆车，$48$ 辆车开走。还剩多少辆？”", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}